WEBVTT

00:01.365 --> 00:03.555
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:03.795 --> 00:06.965
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.335 --> 00:10.065
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.135 --> 00:14.975
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.245 --> 00:23.345
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:23.985 --> 00:26.855
Dragon Drive

00:26.885 --> 00:32.385
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.595 --> 00:35.295
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.395 --> 00:38.565
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.135 --> 00:43.295
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:43.475 --> 00:45.165
ima mo
I'd still...

00:45.475 --> 00:52.175
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:53.515 --> 00:55.715
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:55.885 --> 00:59.115
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.425 --> 01:04.295
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.365 --> 01:05.725
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.095 --> 01:08.465
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:08.595 --> 01:11.765
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.105 --> 01:16.975
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.005 --> 01:19.635
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.045 --> 01:28.045
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:43.935 --> 01:45.695
Y-Young man!

01:49.435 --> 01:52.135
Why don't we threaten the village tonight,
for the first time in a while...

01:52.205 --> 01:53.675
...and have them give us even more gifts?

01:54.775 --> 01:57.905
- What?!
- Those wings are in the way!

02:00.215 --> 02:02.345
Protect the village, self-defense trooper!

02:13.065 --> 02:16.365
To the Legendary Mountain

02:21.005 --> 02:22.095
Now, Chibi!

02:32.015 --> 02:33.915
We're finally done.

02:40.925 --> 02:42.415
Th-There's still more?!

02:46.425 --> 02:48.485
Will you give me a break?

02:49.165 --> 02:53.465
Not even the Training Room at
the Dragon Drive Center was this persistent.

02:55.035 --> 02:56.835
Maybe I'll run away.

02:59.545 --> 03:00.535
Hikaru!

03:03.075 --> 03:05.805
And that guy is the most
persistent of them all.

03:10.885 --> 03:13.445
It doesn't look like they'll
let me escape from here.

03:13.655 --> 03:14.985
Let's do it, Chibi!

03:30.335 --> 03:32.335
He continues to get stronger.

03:32.945 --> 03:34.495
Reiji Ohzora...

03:47.455 --> 03:50.555
This time I'll play to the end, Dad.

03:56.165 --> 03:57.185
What is it?

03:57.565 --> 03:59.225
What in the world's going on?!

04:35.605 --> 04:37.735
Hey, stay still.

04:37.775 --> 04:39.405
You want your injuries to heal, don't you?

04:42.745 --> 04:46.735
Since we're repeatedly being attacked
by wild dragons lately...

04:47.185 --> 04:49.615
Perhaps what the elder said is true.

04:51.225 --> 04:56.025
Why not have Reiji look for
the legendary dragon, SinnSaber?

04:56.325 --> 04:59.385
SinnSaber? That's a good idea.

04:59.695 --> 05:03.155
The journey to find it should prove to be
valuable training for Senkohcoola as well.

05:03.895 --> 05:07.265
Repeated fighting against
those ferocious wild dragons...

05:07.335 --> 05:09.275
...certainly adds up to some great training.

05:10.305 --> 05:13.465
But we'd better hurry to find and
defeat that legendary dragon.

05:13.505 --> 05:15.065
Otherwise, we aren't gonna outlast this.

05:15.115 --> 05:16.165
Right, Chibi?

05:19.115 --> 05:20.675
That mountain.

05:21.415 --> 05:26.875
But can the legendary dragon
really be found there?

05:27.785 --> 05:29.625
We've got no choice but to see for ourselves.

05:34.165 --> 05:35.155
Chibi?

05:37.335 --> 05:39.455
I'm showing a worried expression...

05:39.635 --> 05:41.695
...and that's why Chibi's sensing my anxiety.

05:42.605 --> 05:44.095
Sorry, Chibi.

05:44.745 --> 05:46.675
This is no time to be hesitating.

05:47.005 --> 05:51.845
We have to be a lot stronger
before Kouhei returns.

05:52.215 --> 05:54.075
Isn't that right, Chibi?

05:56.985 --> 05:59.925
Before you do that,
you will accept my challenge.

06:00.925 --> 06:02.655
I forgot all about him.

06:05.125 --> 06:06.385
What is it with you?!

06:06.425 --> 06:08.155
You're really being a pest, you know!

06:09.235 --> 06:11.425
It's about time that
we decided on a winner...

06:11.905 --> 06:12.955
...Reiji Ohzora.

06:13.035 --> 06:15.235
Simply put, he's nothing more than a stalker.

06:15.905 --> 06:17.495
How do I get outta this?

06:28.415 --> 06:32.585
Ichirou is continuing
to stay close by Meguru.

06:32.955 --> 06:35.215
He must really have the hots for her...

06:35.495 --> 06:36.925
...but he hasn't got a chance.

06:37.155 --> 06:39.185
Huh? Why do you say that?

06:39.225 --> 06:43.355
Guys with problems like that
are never popular among girls.

06:43.565 --> 06:46.035
I know that for a fact, through experience.

06:47.835 --> 06:49.035
I disagree!

06:49.175 --> 06:52.145
He may be thinking of only her,
but he is a really great guy!

06:52.245 --> 06:55.675
No. I know. I'm sure.

06:55.775 --> 06:56.745
You guys!

06:57.245 --> 06:59.575
What are you fooling around for?!

07:01.555 --> 07:02.535
M-Maiko.

07:02.755 --> 07:04.545
Hi! How ya doin?!

07:04.755 --> 07:06.155
Don't waste time here!

07:06.185 --> 07:08.415
Go and search for fighters who'll join us!

07:09.355 --> 07:11.985
Well, for your information,
we're not fooling around. Right?

07:12.425 --> 07:13.395
Right.

07:13.425 --> 07:18.335
We're checking to determine whether or not
Ichirou truly intends to join us in our battle.

07:19.405 --> 07:20.925
And? What did you find out?

07:21.105 --> 07:24.005
Actually, nothing yet.

07:24.905 --> 07:26.895
That's pretty much what I expected.

07:27.305 --> 07:29.365
Maiko. What do you think?

07:29.745 --> 07:31.575
Can Ichirou be trusted?

07:32.785 --> 07:33.975
W-Well...

07:34.245 --> 07:35.255
Right?

07:35.255 --> 07:37.415
It's easy for him to say he'll join us...

07:37.585 --> 07:40.025
...but whether we can trust him
or not is another story.

07:40.085 --> 07:41.915
Well, you do have a point.

07:42.395 --> 07:43.915
But he's strong...

07:44.255 --> 07:47.425
...and it would be so reassuring
to have him on our team.

07:47.865 --> 07:51.455
But at one point he fought
on Kouhei's team as our enemy.

07:51.905 --> 07:53.895
It won't be easy to trust him as one of us.

07:54.165 --> 07:55.895
I figured that might be an issue.

07:59.705 --> 08:01.305
I'm at a loss here.

08:01.615 --> 08:04.945
I offered to team up with you,
but no one will trust me.

08:05.115 --> 08:06.515
That leaves me helpless.

08:06.945 --> 08:09.345
What must I do to have you trust me?

08:12.085 --> 08:15.255
Well, I do have
my own objectives as well...

08:15.925 --> 08:18.395
...so I could just as easily
fight independently.

08:18.425 --> 08:19.485
Your own objectives?

08:19.965 --> 08:22.295
So you're that madly in love with Meguru?

08:22.965 --> 08:25.935
As I said, you've got it all wrong!

08:27.135 --> 08:28.225
I don't think so.

08:29.575 --> 08:31.835
If I'm only getting in your way,
I'll be glad to leave.

08:31.875 --> 08:35.275
I'll just have to do things my own way.

08:36.045 --> 08:38.175
Are you saying you'll become our enemy?

08:38.545 --> 08:40.075
That's possible.

08:40.185 --> 08:41.175
Right?

08:50.325 --> 08:52.315
Give it a break, Hikaru!

08:52.495 --> 08:55.255
We're on the same side,
so it doesn't make sense to fight each other.

08:55.935 --> 08:56.985
Same side?

08:57.795 --> 08:59.965
I don't remember ever fighting on your side.

09:00.005 --> 09:03.065
How can you be so stubborn?!

09:03.405 --> 09:06.235
I will never fight against you,
no matter what!

09:06.975 --> 09:07.965
Why not?!

09:09.115 --> 09:11.075
Why won't you fight against me?!

09:11.145 --> 09:12.575
W-Well...

09:13.745 --> 09:14.735
Answer me!

09:18.525 --> 09:20.615
Because I have no reason to fight you!

09:20.785 --> 09:21.585
What?!

09:22.225 --> 09:25.315
It was YOU who first wanted
to fight against ME!

09:25.665 --> 09:28.025
But that was when
we were playing the game!

09:28.265 --> 09:30.025
If we battle it's not a game!

09:30.195 --> 09:31.595
It's a real battle!

09:31.865 --> 09:33.695
There is no real or false in a battle.

09:34.005 --> 09:35.435
The stronger ones win.

09:35.935 --> 09:36.905
That's all that counts.

09:37.105 --> 09:39.695
Is winning fights all that matters to you?!

09:39.975 --> 09:43.505
You know very well
what RI-ON's planning, don't you?!

09:43.945 --> 09:45.205
I'm not interested in that!

09:45.515 --> 09:48.005
I'm only interested in fighting against you!

09:48.045 --> 09:50.715
You are so stubborn!

09:50.885 --> 09:54.375
In the first place, Dragon Drive is fought in
a battle royale format, where anything goes.

09:54.825 --> 09:56.795
There's no need for a reason to fight.

09:57.425 --> 09:59.515
Oh, no. This guy's serious.

10:09.335 --> 10:11.065
All right!

10:11.175 --> 10:12.575
I'll fight you!

10:26.485 --> 10:28.545
We'll begin by taking ten steps
in opposite directions.

10:28.725 --> 10:31.245
On the tenth step,
we'll turn around and begin our battle.

10:31.565 --> 10:32.495
Okay?

10:32.525 --> 10:33.515
Okay.

10:34.025 --> 10:36.465
Make sure you take the full ten steps
before looking back!

10:36.495 --> 10:37.965
Don't cheat.

10:38.235 --> 10:40.205
I got it the first time. Let's begin.

10:46.675 --> 10:47.665
Seven...

10:47.705 --> 10:48.675
...eight...

10:48.715 --> 10:49.675
...nine...

10:49.715 --> 10:50.705
...ten.

10:54.845 --> 10:57.215
Reiji... Ohzora!

11:00.755 --> 11:01.985
Sorry, Hikaru.

11:02.595 --> 11:04.715
This is no time to be fighting against you.

11:22.545 --> 11:23.535
Please.

11:23.715 --> 11:25.075
Awaken.

11:25.585 --> 11:29.985
I cannot return home to Earth
unless you awaken.

11:30.285 --> 11:33.985
I'm sick and tired of all this fighting.

11:34.325 --> 11:37.225
Please return me to Earth.

11:38.025 --> 11:39.825
Why won't you answer me?!

11:40.065 --> 11:40.755
Wake up!

11:41.025 --> 11:42.655
Hurry and open your eyes!

11:50.435 --> 11:51.835
It's useless.

11:52.045 --> 11:52.835
Let's go.

11:52.975 --> 11:53.965
Kyoji.

11:55.215 --> 11:57.145
Even if by chance it did wake up...

11:57.175 --> 12:00.075
...you couldn't control this dragon.

12:00.345 --> 12:03.945
How could you remain so calm, Kyoji?

12:04.315 --> 12:07.315
We may never be able
to get out of this world that's full of dragons.

12:07.355 --> 12:09.285
We may be here for the rest of our lives!

12:09.925 --> 12:11.585
Worrying about it
isn't gonna change anything.

12:13.365 --> 12:15.025
Wait for the time to come.

12:15.365 --> 12:16.625
We will be able to return.

12:18.535 --> 12:19.865
You're right.

12:20.565 --> 12:22.335
What's gotten into me?

12:22.375 --> 12:24.805
I lost my cool there for a moment.

12:27.575 --> 12:28.565
What is it?

12:28.945 --> 12:30.175
No, I just thought...

12:30.215 --> 12:33.335
...I guess even you
cry at times, Sayaka.

12:34.015 --> 12:36.345
I should've brought a handkerchief with me.

12:37.785 --> 12:40.415
A man must pay attention to subtleties
to be popular with women.

12:40.685 --> 12:41.675
Right.

12:41.895 --> 12:43.385
I'll be more careful from now on.

12:50.565 --> 12:53.395
Okay, let's go and look
for some fighters to join us.

12:53.635 --> 12:55.335
Be careful, you two.

12:56.475 --> 12:57.805
We're going again?

12:58.105 --> 13:00.905
Strong guys are tougher to find
than we expected.

13:00.945 --> 13:03.375
Stop complaining, and search!

13:03.715 --> 13:06.875
We've gotta get a move on
before that guy returns!

13:13.355 --> 13:14.345
Maiko.

13:14.655 --> 13:16.745
- Look after things here.
- I know.

13:26.905 --> 13:28.235
Long time no see!

13:28.265 --> 13:30.265
How've you all been?!

13:35.615 --> 13:36.775
Taiyou!

13:37.045 --> 13:38.945
Good to see you, Miss Yukino.

13:38.985 --> 13:39.965
Sun Wols.

13:40.215 --> 13:41.685
What are you doing here?

13:41.815 --> 13:45.275
I heard through the grapevine that you were
looking for some strong dragon masters.

13:45.385 --> 13:48.685
I thought I'd like to join forces with you.

13:49.025 --> 13:51.115
Are you saying that you'll fight with us?

13:51.355 --> 13:52.345
Sure thing.

13:52.465 --> 13:54.295
If it's okay with you guys, that is.

13:54.565 --> 13:57.085
You're welcome any time, Taiyou!

13:58.295 --> 14:01.295
I thought this would be my best chance,
without Reiji around.

14:01.665 --> 14:03.965
But now a powerful rival has appeared.

14:04.005 --> 14:05.235
Exactly!

14:06.705 --> 14:08.195
I-Ichirou!

14:08.405 --> 14:11.105
It must be nice to be accepted
as part of the team right away.

14:11.445 --> 14:14.505
You're not the past champion
of Dragonic Heaven for nothing!

14:15.215 --> 14:16.775
Wh-Why you're...

14:16.815 --> 14:18.805
...Kouhei Toki's teammate.

14:19.725 --> 14:21.055
What are you doing here?

14:21.225 --> 14:26.855
A-Actually, Ichirou is also offering
to fight alongside us...

14:27.125 --> 14:28.065
...but...

14:28.225 --> 14:29.055
Yes.

14:29.095 --> 14:31.155
I'd like to consider myself
as part of this team...

14:31.395 --> 14:33.335
...but no one trusts me.

14:33.435 --> 14:36.235
You don't seriously think
anyone could trust you, do you?

14:36.905 --> 14:38.735
You certainly don't mince words.

14:39.345 --> 14:41.675
What must I do to have people trust me?

14:44.275 --> 14:45.265
Why is it?

14:45.685 --> 14:48.585
Why have you abandoned your friends
to come and team up with us?

14:49.055 --> 14:50.845
You're misunderstanding one thing.

14:51.085 --> 14:53.675
I was never friends with Kouhei.

14:53.985 --> 14:55.975
But you fought on his team.

14:56.355 --> 14:59.015
It was the only way I could get to Rikyu.

14:59.265 --> 15:01.195
I had no choice.

15:01.365 --> 15:02.955
I'm asking you why!

15:03.495 --> 15:04.895
For a particular person.

15:04.965 --> 15:07.435
Is that not a good enough answer for you?

15:07.735 --> 15:10.065
Who is this particular person?

15:14.005 --> 15:16.205
I'm being honest with you.

15:16.345 --> 15:17.475
I'm not lying.

15:19.215 --> 15:20.205
That's right.

15:20.685 --> 15:22.375
I'm not lying.

15:22.815 --> 15:25.985
I've come here,
all for the sake of that person.

15:28.555 --> 15:29.985
For that person.

15:32.325 --> 15:34.925
Ever since I was little...

15:35.025 --> 15:36.725
...I did only as my mother wanted me to.

15:46.345 --> 15:47.305
Ichirou.

15:47.345 --> 15:49.405
As the one who will take over
the family business...

15:49.475 --> 15:52.035
...you must become number one
in everything you do!

15:52.085 --> 15:53.915
But I was happy.

15:54.485 --> 15:57.415
My mother was very strict, demanding that
I be number one at everything I do...

15:57.555 --> 16:00.415
...but she was always watching over me.

16:03.325 --> 16:06.225
Then, suddenly one day,
my mother was killed in an accident.

16:07.025 --> 16:08.425
Things went downhill from there.

16:09.465 --> 16:12.195
No one would pay attention to me.

16:12.905 --> 16:14.425
So I decided...

16:16.475 --> 16:18.035
I would become the best
in everything there is...

16:18.035 --> 16:18.535
Ryugujo: The Sea Palace

16:18.535 --> 16:21.005
Ryugujo: The Sea Palace
...so that people would notice me again.

16:22.345 --> 16:25.105
I set my goal on becoming
number one player in Dragon Drive.

16:25.215 --> 16:25.975
However...

16:27.415 --> 16:29.175
I kept losing at first.

16:29.555 --> 16:31.315
No matter how many times I tried.

16:31.785 --> 16:33.275
I was so frustrated.

16:39.165 --> 16:41.215
What's so great about getting all ex cited...

16:41.695 --> 16:43.285
...over some game, anyway?!

16:49.135 --> 16:51.125
Hey, you. You dropped something.

16:51.905 --> 16:53.135
I didn't drop it.

16:53.275 --> 16:54.465
I threw it away.

16:54.975 --> 16:56.465
I'm no longer interested in that.

16:57.245 --> 17:00.145
I was so sure that you could
become number one in this.

17:00.615 --> 17:02.985
What a pity, Ichirou Sumishiba.

17:03.415 --> 17:04.405
Huh?

17:09.195 --> 17:12.485
If you're gonna quit, why not do so
after you've become number one?

17:12.625 --> 17:14.655
You have what it takes, Ichirou...

17:15.025 --> 17:16.995
...so it shouldn't take you too long.

17:18.595 --> 17:19.995
Number one?

17:21.405 --> 17:22.665
Good luck.

17:24.635 --> 17:25.835
I was surprised.

17:26.205 --> 17:27.935
There was someone other than my mother...

17:27.975 --> 17:30.005
...who actually paid attention to me.

17:51.035 --> 17:52.865
That person was watching over me.

17:53.365 --> 17:55.195
I was thrilled just to know that.

17:57.035 --> 17:58.025
Please.

17:58.335 --> 18:00.035
Please find Meguru.

18:00.675 --> 18:01.665
But...

18:02.115 --> 18:05.515
To me, that girl is...

18:06.045 --> 18:08.445
...my one and only sister.

18:09.155 --> 18:10.875
It was a request coming directly from her.

18:10.915 --> 18:14.045
I need to keep my promise
no matter what it takes.

18:18.125 --> 18:19.785
I cannot fight alongside you!

18:20.165 --> 18:22.155
So you won't trust me.

18:23.195 --> 18:26.225
Then it would be in your best interest
to defeat me right here and now.

18:26.565 --> 18:29.005
I may become your enemy again, after all!

18:29.675 --> 18:31.725
Hayate Slash!

18:42.415 --> 18:45.875
I was a bit disappointed that I could not
fight against you the other day.

18:46.385 --> 18:49.375
You were defeated by Kouhei
so easily that day.

18:49.725 --> 18:53.125
I hope you don't think I was fighting
the best I could then!

18:57.895 --> 18:58.795
I see.

18:59.435 --> 19:03.395
So this is the true power of
the previous Dragonic Heaven champion!

19:12.215 --> 19:14.185
Rockaku! Make them stop!

19:14.615 --> 19:16.275
I'd like to... but, you know...

19:18.255 --> 19:20.885
At this point, there's no stopping them.

19:21.725 --> 19:22.885
Oh no!

19:32.135 --> 19:33.465
Stop it, already!

19:35.135 --> 19:36.935
Please stop fighting!

19:37.105 --> 19:38.125
Get outta the way!

19:38.335 --> 19:39.805
Unless I do something about him...

19:39.845 --> 19:43.005
...I could end up putting
our friends in danger!

19:43.215 --> 19:44.705
I...

19:46.715 --> 19:48.375
I trust him!

19:48.515 --> 19:49.815
- Really?!
- Really?!

19:52.015 --> 19:53.785
Then I shall get rid of you as well!

20:00.265 --> 20:01.785
Stop it!

20:20.115 --> 20:23.015
The stance you just took
trying to protect her...

20:23.215 --> 20:24.515
...spontaneous actions don't lie!

20:27.955 --> 20:29.885
I also trust you.

20:30.425 --> 20:33.355
Although it's up to you
whether or not we can become friends.

20:34.225 --> 20:35.525
I may...

20:35.895 --> 20:36.795
...betray you.

20:37.865 --> 20:39.525
You won't betray us.

20:43.975 --> 20:45.195
Hey, hey.

20:45.375 --> 20:46.865
What just happened here?

20:47.005 --> 20:48.565
It's the power of love!

20:48.645 --> 20:50.575
The power of love, huh.

20:50.675 --> 20:53.205
How wonderful to see
people in love with each other.

20:53.245 --> 20:54.545
Yes!

20:56.215 --> 20:58.085
What a pathetic way to spend one's youth.

21:05.095 --> 21:06.385
This place...

21:07.965 --> 21:09.795
Has that thing broken down again?!

21:09.865 --> 21:11.055
You mustn't move yet!

21:12.235 --> 21:13.395
Let go of me.

21:13.505 --> 21:14.725
I'm busy.

21:14.805 --> 21:15.995
Wait, Kouhei.

21:16.205 --> 21:17.395
Don't get in my way.

21:24.975 --> 21:27.915
Will I really find the legendary dragon here?

21:32.425 --> 21:33.585
Let's go, Chibi!

21:55.945 --> 21:58.605
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:58.675 --> 22:01.305
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:01.385 --> 22:05.285
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:06.855 --> 22:09.375
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:09.625 --> 22:11.955
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.225 --> 22:16.215
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:17.735 --> 22:19.755
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:20.465 --> 22:22.805
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.175 --> 22:27.165
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:28.545 --> 22:30.635
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.375 --> 22:33.775
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:33.945 --> 22:39.015
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:39.525 --> 22:42.045
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.185 --> 22:44.785
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:44.995 --> 22:49.655
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:50.435 --> 22:52.995
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.135 --> 22:55.655
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:55.875 --> 23:00.605
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.175 --> 23:05.575
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:06.615 --> 23:12.285
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:14.685 --> 23:17.355
Next time

23:17.355 --> 23:21.225
Darn it, where is that legendary dragon,
SinnSaber, anyway?

23:21.865 --> 23:23.835
We must acquire its power quickly...

23:24.065 --> 23:26.365
...before Kouhei Toki returns!

23:27.305 --> 23:28.355
What's that?!

23:28.505 --> 23:31.195
We have a lead to
where we can find SinnSaber?!

23:31.905 --> 23:33.635
There's a witness?!

23:33.675 --> 23:36.405
Okay, let's go!

23:37.475 --> 23:40.105
Next, on Dragon Drive, "Runaway".

23:40.515 --> 23:41.545
What I wanna know is,
why is Hikaru still with us?!

23:41.545 --> 23:43.255
Runaway
What I wanna know is,
why is Hikaru still with us?!

23:43.255 --> 23:43.285
Runaway

23:43.285 --> 23:44.375
Runaway
Such a pest!
